OL,5,
OL,6,FBody-worn camera footage, played to the
OL,7,Fjury, showed officers knocking on the
OL,8,Fdoor to the flat in Gerards Court, St
OL,9,FHelens, at about 16:30 GMT on 8
OL,10,FJanuary.
